{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/activeadmin/activeadmin/issues/783","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/activeadmin/activeadmin","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/activeadmin/activeadmin/issues/783/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/activeadmin/activeadmin/issues/783/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/activeadmin/activeadmin/issues/783/events","html_url":"https://github.com/activeadmin/activeadmin/issues/783","id":2343254,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyMzQzMjU0","number":783,"title":"Install issue regarding migrations","user":{"login":"robotmay","id":94277,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0Mjc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94277?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotmay","html_url":"https://github.com/robotmay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotmay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotmay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotmay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotmay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotmay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotmay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotmay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotmay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotmay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":103370,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDMzNzA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/activeadmin/activeadmin/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"EE3F46","default":true,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":66,"created_at":"2011-11-24T16:40:20Z","updated_at":"2024-07-14T11:26:22Z","closed_at":"2023-03-12T20:56:10Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Just ran across something which caused me a bit of a headache; finally figured out what it was!\nInstalling for the first time I get an exception when generating the assets:\n\n```\nrails g active_admin:install\n# ...\n    generate  active_admin:assets\nMysql2::Error: Table 'fwd_development.active_admin_comments' doesn't exist: SHOW FIELDS FROM `active_admin_comments` (ActiveRecord::StatementInvalid)\n# ...\n      create  db/migrate/20111124160741_create_admin_notes.rb\n      create  db/migrate/20111124160742_move_admin_notes_to_comments.rb\n```\n\nThen, when running the migrations I got the same error:\n\n```\nrake db:migrate\nrake aborted!\nMysql2::Error: Table 'fwd_development.active_admin_comments' doesn't exist: SHOW FIELDS FROM 'active_admin_comments'\n\nTasks: TOP => db:migrate => environment\n(See full trace by running task with --trace)\n```\n\nI was able to get past the migration error by removing the following two lines from the routes.rb file and putting them back afterwards:\n\n``` ruby\nActiveAdmin.routes(self)\ndevise_for :admin_users, ActiveAdmin::Devise.config\n```\n\nI then successfully generated the assets using  `rails generate active_admin:assets`.\n\nNot sure if anyone else has experienced this but I thought I'd report it anyway :)\nI'm using the master branch, by the way. \n","closed_by":{"login":"javierjulio","id":198547,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODU0Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198547?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/javierjulio","html_url":"https://github.com/javierjulio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javierjulio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javierjulio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javierjulio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/javierj